@startuml
!include r4-sequence-style.puml
title FE-12 Evaluate Design and Produce Workshop Recommendation
actor "Member" as member
participant "WorkshopRingDesignController" as designController
participant "WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService" as designService
participant "DesignRuleFacade" as ruleFacade
participant "WorkshopRecommendation" as recommendation
participant "WorkshopPackageDetails" as packageDetails
participant "DesignRequestController" as requestController

member -> designController : evaluate saved design
activate designController
designController -> designService : load owned design
activate designService
designService -> ruleFacade : evaluate material, shape, stones and engraving
activate ruleFacade
ruleFacade --> designService : difficulty, estimate and warnings
deactivate ruleFacade
designService -> recommendation : apply server thresholds
activate recommendation
recommendation --> designService : package, reason and advisory note
deactivate recommendation
designService --> designController : evaluation and recommendation
deactivate designService
designController --> member : result + Recommended link + Explore workshops
deactivate designController
alt Member follows workshop recommendation
  member -> packageDetails : open recommended workshop package
else Member uses design idea for custom product
  member -> requestController : start request with saved design reference
  requestController --> member : human review and quote flow
end

note over member
More than five stones recommends Silver Clay.
Difficulty above nine recommends Wax Casting
with two sessions on different days.
Recommendation does not create a booking.
Custom product purchase requires review,
approved quote and full payment.
end note
@enduml
